& Spatial filtering handles overlapped speech.
& Requires multi-channel microphone arrays. \\ \hline
\multirow{2}{2.2cm}{Domain adaptation}
& Daouad et al. (2024) \cite{daouad2024optimizing}; Polat et al. (2024) \cite{polat2024implementation}
