& Durmus et al. (2026) \cite{durmus2026contextual}
& Entity-focused benchmarks expose named-entity failures hidden by aggregate WER.
& Benchmark only; no mitigation mechanism per se. \\ \hline
\multirow{2}{2.2cm}{Streaming \& diarization}
& Sainath et al. (2020) \cite{sainath2020streaming}; Sklyar et al. (2021) \cite{sklyar2021streaming}
