\textbf{Characteristic} & \textbf{Value} \\ \hline
Evaluation environment & CPU-only Linux sandbox (no GPU) \\ \hline
Operating system & Ubuntu 22.04 \\ \hline
Python version & 3.10 \\ \hline
Whisper compute type & INT8 quantisation (CPU) \\ \hline
GPU extension run & NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (8\,GB VRAM), float16 \\ \hline
\end{tabular}
\caption{Hardware environment}
\label{tab:hardware}
\end{table}
\subsection{Software Environment}
Table~\ref{tab:software} lists the main software tools used, with their role in the implementation.
